    <string name="audio_latency">Audio latency</string>
    <string name="latency_value">%1$.2f s</string>
    <string name="latency_note">How much audio the speaker buffers before it plays. Lower = more responsive, but below roughly 0.5 s a slow Wi-Fi link may stutter. The wire\'s own floor is 0.25 s, so that is as low as the slider goes. Applies to the next cast.</string>
