    <string name="section_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_row">About &amp; open-source licences</string>
    <string name="about_body">Streams audio from this phone to AirPlay 2 speakers.\n\nDesigned and built by Brian: the interface and the app code are original work, while the copyright notices of every bundled component are preserved in the NOTICE and LICENSE files.\n\nIncludes open-source code licensed under Apache-2.0.\n\nNot affiliated with, or endorsed by, Apple Inc. \"AirPlay\" and \"HomePod\" are trademarks of Apple Inc., used only to describe compatibility.\n\nOpen-source components:\n• airplay2-sender-cpp — Apache-2.0\n• mbedTLS — Apache-2.0\n• ed25519 (orlp) — zlib\n\nAudio is processed entirely on-device; nothing is collected.</string>

